OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786043913
OL,3,CFormula milk prices see parents
OL,4,Cresorting to 'unsafe' feeding, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FParents have detailed the devastating
OL,8,Fimpact soaring infant milk formula has
OL,9,Fhad on their mental and physical
OL,10,Fhealth.
OL,12,FA new study led by Swansea University
OL,13,Ffound that nearly 40% of parents
OL,14,Fsurveyed resorted to "unsafe feeding
OL,15,Fpractices, including reusing leftover
OL,16,Fformula, watering down formula, and
OL,17,Freducing sterilisation".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/9
