FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786043913
OL,3,CFormula milk prices see parents
OL,4,Cresorting to 'unsafe' feeding, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FOne mother surveyed said the pressure
OL,8,Fof increased formula milk prices led
OL,9,Fto her feeling regret towards having
OL,10,Fher child.
OL,12,FShe said: "Sometimes I regret having
OL,13,Fthis baby and I feel awful about
OL,14,Fhaving those thoughts because I love
OL,15,Fher so much but I'm not a good mum to
OL,16,Fher".
OL,18,FThe survey, which is the first of its
OL,19,Fkind in the UK, explored the
OL,20,Fexperiences of 281 parents across the
OL,21,FUK.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
