CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786043913
OL,3,CFormula milk prices see parents
OL,4,Cresorting to 'unsafe' feeding, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FIt found that formula prices rose up
OL,8,Fto 45% between 2021 and 2023, while a
OL,9,Fseparate report by the Competition and
OL,10,FMarkets Authority saw profit margins
OL,11,Fof between 50-75% on the formula.
OL,13,FThe survey also found parents made
OL,14,Fpersonal sacrifices to keep up with
OL,15,Fformula prices.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786043913
OL,3,CFormula milk prices see parents
OL,4,Cresorting to 'unsafe' feeding, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FMore than a third of parents (37%)
OL,8,Fleft their homes unheated, 43% fell
OL,9,Fbehind on bills, and nearly half (47%)
OL,10,Ftook on debts that are difficult to
OL,11,Frepay. For 21% of mothers, it meant
OL,12,Fcutting maternity leave short to
OL,13,Freturn to work early.
OL,15,FNearly half of the families (48%)
OL,16,Fintroduced solid foods before their
OL,17,Fbaby was ready, or switched to cheaper
OL,18,Fmilk intended for older babies (45%).
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
