PN,43205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786043913
OL,3,CFormula milk prices see parents
OL,4,Cresorting to 'unsafe' feeding, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FOne parent, who has been kept
OL,8,Fanonymous, said: "I've had to use less
OL,9,Fpowder just to be able to, you know,
OL,10,Fget to a new week, so that I can plan
OL,11,Ffor a new one... The only thing I've
OL,12,Fdone during difficult times is I try
OL,13,Fto use less powder, and which is
OL,14,Freally bad. Yeah, I've used less
OL,15,Fpowder before, which is really bad".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
