PN,43206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786043913
OL,3,CFormula milk prices see parents
OL,4,Cresorting to 'unsafe' feeding, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FAnother said: "So we started weaning
OL,8,Fearly because the formula was getting
OL,9,Fa bit too stressful for us. And then
OL,10,Fhis feeding difficulties as well as
OL,11,Fthe expense. So we started weaning at
OL,12,F3 1/2 4 months".
OL,14,FWhile another added: "I don't want to
OL,15,Fbe breastfeeding any more but it saves
OL,16,Fmoney so feel I have to".
