PN,43207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786043913
OL,3,CFormula milk prices see parents
OL,4,Cresorting to 'unsafe' feeding, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FAmy Brown, a Professor of Public
OL,8,FHealth at Swansea University, who led
OL,9,Fthe study, said: "This is a
OL,10,Fsignificant issue because infant
OL,11,Fformula is not a discretionary
OL,12,Fproduct. When infants are not
OL,13,Fbreastfed or not fully breastfed,
OL,14,Finfant formula is needed to support
OL,15,Fgrowth and development. The worrying
OL,16,Fand rapid changes in the formula
OL,17,Fmarket coincide with the broader cost-
OL,18,Fof-living crisis, with many families
OL,19,Falready struggling to get by."
OL,26,@qD@ROU{D@^O]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/9
