PN,43209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786043913
OL,3,CFormula milk prices see parents
OL,4,Cresorting to 'unsafe' feeding, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,F"Our research shows that we urgently
OL,8,Fneed more holistic support across
OL,9,Finfant feeding that both ensures more
OL,10,Fwomen who want to breastfeed can do
OL,11,Fso, and those who are using formula
OL,12,Fhave reliable access to affordable
OL,13,Fproducts that put babies and parents
OL,14,Ffirst. This would help to ensure
OL,15,Fgreater infant food security,
OL,16,Fprotecting both infant health and
OL,17,Fnutrition but wider development and
OL,18,Ffamily wellbeing."
OL,26,@oD@AOUzD@RO]
